   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# STEP 17 — Interpret the Result\n",
    "\n",
    "## Result Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "### What happened?\n",
    "Job match scores were calculated by combining skill match, education match, experience match, role relevance, and text similarity.\n",
    "\n",
    "### What does it mean?\n",
    "Each job now has a match score indicating how well the candidate fits the position.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why does it matter?\n",
    "The match scores enable personalized job recommendations and identify skill gaps.\n",
    "\n",
    "### What decision does it support?\n",
    "The scores will be used for job recommendations and career readiness analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "### What limitation should be considered?\n",
    "The weights are design choices and may not be optimal. The matching is based on keyword matching and may miss semantic relationships."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
